#: manual/api/score.md:5
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/mooncake-impact-factor/score` computes the impact score of a MoonBit package from four integer signals, labels the score with a rank and a momentum class, and bundles everything into a `ScoreSnapshot`. Every function is pure and total: it never aborts and has no hidden state."
msgstr ""

